    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD Pattern</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Pattern: Managing Long-running Tasks</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Some work takes 45 seconds, 10 minutes or 3 hours. After this page you will know how to take that work out of the request path, run it safely on workers that can crash, and tell the user when it is finished - and you will be able to say it in an interview in two minutes.</p>\n      "
